WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:04.300
-Welcome, welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:07.167
You're here. You're watching.
Thank you very much.

00:00:07.167 --> 00:00:09.968
Well, guys, as the war in
Ukraine continues,

00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:12.634
everyone has a theory about how
to resolve the conflict.

00:00:12.634 --> 00:00:15.501
Well, this weekend,
former president Trump

00:00:15.501 --> 00:00:16.968
had an interesting idea.

00:00:16.968 --> 00:00:19.701
He said that the U.S.
should paint Chinese flags

00:00:19.701 --> 00:00:22.801
on its planes
and then bomb Russia.

00:00:22.801 --> 00:00:26.400
So, if you're wondering what
Trump has been up to lately,

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:28.200
the answer is huffing glue.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:30.167
I don't know.

00:00:30.167 --> 00:00:31.868
These are the types of ideas
you come up with

00:00:31.868 --> 00:00:32.968
after you stare at the sun
too long.

00:00:32.968 --> 00:00:34.167
Do you know what
I'm talking about?

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:35.701
This is...

00:00:35.701 --> 00:00:37.601
Then Trump said that
he would stop Russian tanks

00:00:37.601 --> 00:00:39.400
by painting a tunnel
on the side of a mountain

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:41.167
so they slam into it.

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:43.567
[ As Trump ] Meep-meep.

00:00:45.133 --> 00:00:46.267
[ Normal voice ] And get this.

00:00:46.267 --> 00:00:48.501
On Saturday,
Ukrainian President Zelensky

00:00:48.501 --> 00:00:51.067
held a Zoom call
with U.S. lawmakers.

00:00:51.067 --> 00:00:52.534
And at one point
during the meeting,

00:00:52.534 --> 00:00:56.701
he asked Florida Senator
Rick Scott to mute himself.

00:00:57.501 --> 00:00:59.734
You all know Senator Rick Scott
from Florida.

00:00:59.734 --> 00:01:01.300
Yeah.

00:01:03.033 --> 00:01:05.300
Zelensky was like, "And you can
turn your camera off, too,

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:06.601
if you want to."

00:01:06.601 --> 00:01:07.868
It's amazing.

00:01:07.868 --> 00:01:10.267
With everything Zelensky
is dealing with, even he's like,

00:01:10.267 --> 00:01:11.467
"Freaking Florida.

00:01:11.467 --> 00:01:12.734
You know what I'm saying?"

00:01:12.734 --> 00:01:14.567
Yeah, it turns out there was
a guy in the back of

00:01:14.567 --> 00:01:16.000
Rick Scott's Zoom yelling,

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.801
"Tell him about my
painted-planes idea."

00:01:22.968 --> 00:01:25.634
Well, as companies continue to
distance themselves from Russia,

00:01:25.634 --> 00:01:28.501
TikTok just announced
that users in the country

00:01:28.501 --> 00:01:30.667
can no longer post videos.

00:01:30.667 --> 00:01:32.534
Yep, when they heard
TikTok was banned,

00:01:32.534 --> 00:01:33.834
Russians were like...

00:01:33.834 --> 00:01:35.100
-♪ Oh, nyet ♪

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:36.467
♪ Oh, nyet ♪

00:01:36.467 --> 00:01:39.267
♪ Oh, nyet, nyet, nyet, nyet ♪

00:01:39.267 --> 00:01:43.167
[ Cheers and applause ]
-"Oh, nyet."

00:01:43.167 --> 00:01:46.501
-It's topical.
That's nice. Come on.

00:01:46.501 --> 00:01:49.200
-Yeah, no TikTok, Facebook,
or Twitter.

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:50.934
Right now,
Tom from MySpace is like,

00:01:50.934 --> 00:01:54.300
"Well, well, well,
look who came crawling back."

00:01:54.901 --> 00:01:57.267
Meanwhile here in the U.S.,
a convoy of truckers

00:01:57.267 --> 00:02:00.234
spent the last two days circling
the Capital Beltway

00:02:00.234 --> 00:02:03.701
outside D.C.
to protest COVID restrictions.

00:02:03.701 --> 00:02:06.234
Yep, the truckers waited
until all the mandates

00:02:06.234 --> 00:02:12.167
were lifted and gas hit 5 bucks
a gallon, so great timing.

00:02:12.167 --> 00:02:13.400
Let's change gears.

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:15.734
"The Batman" just had
a huge opening weekend.

00:02:15.734 --> 00:02:17.133
Did you see it?
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:17.133 --> 00:02:18.734
Yeah, it was good.

00:02:20.334 --> 00:02:22.701
One theater in Texas
had an unexpected issue

00:02:22.701 --> 00:02:24.200
during a screening of the movie.

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:25.434
Watch this.

00:02:25.434 --> 00:02:28.033
-During a showing of
the new movie "The Batman"

00:02:28.033 --> 00:02:29.334
this weekend in Austin,

00:02:29.334 --> 00:02:32.467
an actual bat
infiltrated the theater.

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:35.634
-At first,
people were like, "Finally.

00:02:35.634 --> 00:02:36.834
3-D without the glasses.

00:02:36.834 --> 00:02:40.200
They've done it!
They figured it out!"

00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:42.734
It got weird when, a few minutes
later, a penguin waddled inside.

00:02:42.734 --> 00:02:45.267
They're like, "What the hell
is happening here?"

00:02:45.267 --> 00:02:46.701
In the end,
they got the bat to leave

00:02:46.701 --> 00:02:48.667
by telling him the movie
was three hours long.

00:02:48.667 --> 00:02:50.567
He's like, "I got things to do."
I got things to do."

00:02:50.567 --> 00:02:51.968
Some more entertainment news.

00:02:51.968 --> 00:02:55.000
Last night, a new reality dating
show called "The Courtship"

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:57.234
premiered on NBC,
and it's being described as

00:02:57.234 --> 00:03:00.501
a mix between "The Bachelor"
and "Bridgerton."

00:03:00.501 --> 00:03:02.167
But unlike "The Bachelor,"

00:03:02.167 --> 00:03:04.267
the only disease they get
from the hot tub is scurvy.

00:03:04.267 --> 00:03:05.501
-Oh.
-Yeah.

00:03:05.501 --> 00:03:08.067
[ Laughter ]
Thank you.

00:03:08.067 --> 00:03:10.434
Yeah, it's a fun idea, although
the romance takes a while

00:03:10.434 --> 00:03:13.868
to get going because every piece
of clothing has 125 buttons.

00:03:17.434 --> 00:03:19.467
And, finally, the world's
largest cruise ship

00:03:19.467 --> 00:03:21.567
just set sail
on its first voyage.

00:03:21.567 --> 00:03:23.968
The ship is called
the "Wonder of the Seas"

00:03:23.968 --> 00:03:26.200
and is five times bigger than
the "Titanic."

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:29.567
Meanwhile, passengers are like,
"Cool, but let's maybe not

00:03:29.567 --> 00:03:31.100
compare any ship
to the 'Titanic,' okay?"

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:32.133
We have a great show.

